<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2025-09-17T06:31:41+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Wed, 17 Sep 2025 06:31:41 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title>Trump lands in UK: Trade, Ukraine war and meeting with King Charles – what’s on the agenda</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123932972.cms" /&gt;Donald Trump's state visit to the UK commenced amidst royal welcomes, trade agreements, and political debates. Hosted by King Charles III, Trump aims to strengthen transatlantic ties through discussions with Prime Minister Sir Keir Starmer. The visit includes a "Tech Prosperity Deal" with significant US investments, but also faces protests and disagreements over foreign policy, particularly regarding the Ukraine conflict.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/donald-trump-in-uk-meetings-with-king-charles-and-starmer-whats-on-the-agenda/articleshow/123932972.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/donald-trump-in-uk-meetings-with-king-charles-and-starmer-whats-on-the-agenda/articleshow/123932972.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T06:24:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123932971,imgsize-828374.cms"/></item><item><title>‘How will I explain losing it’: Texts reveal Tyler Robinson’s panic over rifle after Kirk killing— and plea to partner</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123932864.cms" /&gt;Tyler Robinson is accused of killing conservative activist Charlie Kirk. Robinson reportedly confessed to his partner via text. The messages reveal planning and motive. Robinson worried about a rifle used in the shooting. The rifle was a family heirloom. Robinson's DNA was found on the weapon. He asked his partner to delete messages. Robinson was arrested after a standoff.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/how-will-i-explain-losing-it-texts-reveal-tyler-robinsons-panic-over-rifle-after-kirk-killing-and-plea-to-partner/articleshow/123932864.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/how-will-i-explain-losing-it-texts-reveal-tyler-robinsons-panic-over-rifle-after-kirk-killing-and-plea-to-partner/articleshow/123932864.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T05:56:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123932860,imgsize-1130275.cms"/></item><item><title>'About time!' Donald Trump ramps up attacks on NYT after $15bn lawsuit; accuses left-wing media of trying to ‘destroy US’</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123932901.cms" /&gt;Donald Trump has launched a $15 billion defamation lawsuit against The New York Times, accusing the newspaper of a long-standing smear campaign. Filed in Florida, the suit targets several reporters, the paper, and its publisher, citing articles and a book as evidence of malicious defamation.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/about-time-donald-trump-ramps-up-attacks-on-nyt-after-15bn-lawsuit-accuses-left-wing-media-of-trying-to-destroy-us/articleshow/123932901.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/about-time-donald-trump-ramps-up-attacks-on-nyt-after-15bn-lawsuit-accuses-left-wing-media-of-trying-to-destroy-us/articleshow/123932901.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T06:09:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123932899,imgsize-757976.cms"/></item><item><title>Is UPI available in Gulf countries? How Indian expats can use UPI across banks and apps: All you need to know</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123930282.cms" /&gt;UPI’s presence is rapidly expanding across the GCC, offering residents, travelers, and businesses a seamless, real-time payment solution. With its integration into countries like the UAE, Qatar, and Saudi Arabia, UPI simplifies cross-border transactions, making payments easier for Indian expatriates and tourists. Through strategic partnerships, UPI is positioned to transform digital payment systems in the region, supporting cashless economies.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/is-upi-available-in-gulf-countries-how-indian-expats-can-use-upi-across-banks-and-apps-all-you-need-to-know/articleshow/123930282.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/is-upi-available-in-gulf-countries-how-indian-expats-can-use-upi-across-banks-and-apps-all-you-need-to-know/articleshow/123930282.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T03:41:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123930701,imgsize-1260098.cms"/></item><item><title>Canada minister, whose resignation made Trudeau quit, leaving Carney's cabinet</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123930644.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canada-minister-whose-resignation-made-trudeau-quit-leaving-carneys-cabinet/articleshow/123930644.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canada-minister-whose-resignation-made-trudeau-quit-leaving-carneys-cabinet/articleshow/123930644.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T03:15:06+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123930648,imgsize-34826.cms"/></item><item><title>State has no right to discriminate, says Yunus ahead of Durga Puja</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123930632.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/state-has-no-right-to-discriminate-says-yunus-ahead-of-durga-puja/articleshow/123930632.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/state-has-no-right-to-discriminate-says-yunus-ahead-of-durga-puja/articleshow/123930632.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T03:12:56+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123930643,imgsize-799630.cms"/></item><item><title>Trey Reed and Corey Zukatis: Mystery over two men found hanging in two different parts of Mississippi</title><descript