earing-for-life/articleshow/123926943.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/began-to-fear-for-life-a-fathers-post-on-mississippis-trey-reed-suicide-goes-viral-our-son-left-fearing-for-life/articleshow/123926943.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-16T22:30:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123926964,imgsize-30426.cms"/></item><item><title>Does Utah have death penalty? What will happen to Charlie Kirk murder suspect, Tyler Robinson?</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123926559.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/does-utah-have-death-penalty-what-will-happen-to-charlie-kirk-murder-suspect-tyler-robinson/articleshow/123926559.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/does-utah-have-death-penalty-what-will-happen-to-charlie-kirk-murder-suspect-tyler-robinson/articleshow/123926559.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-16T21:50:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123926537,imgsize-18106.cms"/></item><item><title>'More than 20 people...': Who were among Tyler Robinson's 'network' who possibly knew about plan to 'take out' Charlie Kirk?</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123926215.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/more-than-20-people-who-were-among-tyler-robinsons-network-who-possibly-knew-about-plan-to-take-out-charlie-kirk/articleshow/123926215.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/more-than-20-people-who-were-among-tyler-robinsons-network-who-possibly-knew-about-plan-to-take-out-charlie-kirk/articleshow/123926215.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-16T21:15:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123926199,imgsize-1649852.cms"/></item><item><title>Kenya court seeks UK citizen's arrest over young mother's murder</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123926551.cms" /&gt;A Nairobi court issued an arrest warrant Tuesday for a British citizen in connection with the high-profile death of a young Kenyan mother whose body was found in a septic tank over a decade ago. Nairobi High Court judge Alexander Muteti said there was "probable cause to order the arrest of the accused and his surrender before this court for his trial", granting a warrant for "one citizen and resident of the United Kingdom".</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/kenya-court-seeks-uk-citizens-arrest-over-young-mothers-murder/articleshow/123926551.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/kenya-court-seeks-uk-citizens-arrest-over-young-mothers-murder/articleshow/123926551.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-16T21:49:22+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123926614,imgsize-1072354.cms"/></item><item><title>WiFi ban to curb 'immorality': Taliban blocks fibre internet in Afghan province; orders 'complete ban'</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123923502.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/wifi-ban-to-curb-immorality-taliban-blocks-fibre-internet-in-afghan-province-orders-complete-ban/articleshow/123923502.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/wifi-ban-to-curb-immorality-taliban-blocks-fibre-internet-in-afghan-province-orders-complete-ban/articleshow/123923502.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-16T20:35:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123923826,imgsize-1188366.cms"/></item><item><title>Luigi Mangione case: Judge drops terrorism charges, but murder trial to proceed</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123925595.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/luigi-mangione-case-judge-drops-terrorism-charges-in-unitedhealthcare-ceo-killing-murder-trial-to-proceed/articleshow/123925595.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/luigi-mangione-case-judge-drops-terrorism-charges-in-unitedhealthcare-ceo-killing-murder-trial-to-proceed/articleshow/123925595.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-16T20:26:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123925592,imgsize-39020.cms"/></item></channel></rss>